                                "sense_id": "72169ae2-6c65-3af1-927b-302ac7341bae",
                                "text": "European colonialism exported its domestic, counter-revolutionary Inquisition around the world, starting with Portuguese expansionism around 1500 C.E."
                            }
                        ]
